BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:asyo-fall-concert@asyo.hub
SUMMARY:Fall Concert
DTSTART:20260905T190000
DTEND:20260905T210000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:Alpharetta Performing Arts Center (demo)
DESCRIPTION:Youth Symphony\, Youth Philharmonia\, Prelude Strings\nRepertoi
 re: Simple Gifts (arr. strings) — Traditional Shaker melody · Hungarian Da
 nce No. 5 — Johannes Brahms · Symphony No. 8 — Finale — Antonín Dvořák · T
 he Barber of Seville — Overture — Gioachino Rossini\nAll three orchestras.
  Rossini is the side-by-side finale — Philharmonia sits in with the Youth 
 Symphony.
END:VEVENT
